# Site-specific additions to /usr/bin/redshift's AppArmor profile, installed
# by dotfiles-redshift.
#
# Debian's profile only allows the pre-1.12 config path ~/.config/redshift.conf.
# Redshift 1.12 also reads ~/.config/redshift/redshift.conf, and in the dotfiles
# that directory is a symlink into the repo checkout, which AppArmor resolves
# before matching. Hence the second, wildcarded rule.
owner @{HOME}/.config/redshift/redshift.conf r,
owner @{HOME}/**/.config/redshift/redshift.conf r,
